1
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:52,990
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:56,010
[Episode 12]

3
00:00:56,130 --> 00:01:04,060
[Autopsy Room 1] [Morgue]

4
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:58,200
The deceased's family.

5
00:01:07,350 --> 00:01:08,140
My son...

6
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:13,600
My son!

7
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:19,120
My son...

8
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,870
Heaven,

9
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:25,340
why can't you see?

10
00:01:26,410 --> 00:01:28,240
If someone had to be taken,

11
00:01:28,350 --> 00:01:30,240
i-it should've been me!

12
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:32,780
Why did you take my son?

13
00:01:32,810 --> 00:01:35,500
Does it please you

14
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,539
to see the old

15
00:01:37,539 --> 00:01:39,930
bury the young?

16
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:44,340
How is this even fair?

17
00:01:45,979 --> 00:01:49,259
My son...

18
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,590
I offer you my condolences.

19
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:57,800
[Anatomy Room 2] [Postmortem Room 2]

20
00:02:02,370 --> 00:02:03,410
What are you writing?

21
00:02:04,370 --> 00:02:05,180
You won't let me see.

22
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,930
Parents burying their child...

23
00:02:12,530 --> 00:02:13,280
What a tragedy.

24
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,300
Aren't you in town to investigate
Zhao Changyou?

25
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,300
What are you doing here?

26
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:25,060
During the investigation
of Zhao Changyou's social connections,

27
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:27,360
I found that he often
went to Shasha Hair Salon.

28
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,079
Before Li Dewu died,

29
00:02:29,079 --> 00:02:31,079
he also just visited Shasha Hair Salon.

30
00:02:31,650 --> 00:02:32,870
So I thought I'd come and see

31
00:02:32,870 --> 00:02:34,079
if they were connected in any way.

32
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:36,560
Any findings?

33
00:02:36,970 --> 00:02:37,800
Did they know each other?

34
00:02:38,370 --> 00:02:39,329
Wang Ping said they both

35
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,190
got their hair washed at her place.

36
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,180
They were never together.

37
00:02:43,690 --> 00:02:45,550
Nor did she see
they ever run into each other.

38
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:47,410
You really think they'd go there together?

39
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:49,520
Could it have happened—
two man at the same time?

40
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,860
Think about it.

41
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:56,370
One died shortly after the other did.

42
00:02:56,370 --> 00:02:57,800
Both deaths happened at Yuhong Square.

43
00:02:58,250 --> 00:02:59,520
The victims were both businessmen

44
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,080
with complicated social relations.

45
00:03:02,150 --> 00:03:03,800
There are no ties between them
on the surface,

46
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,590
but it doesn't mean
there aren't any in private.

47
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,710
Go on.

48
00:03:11,930 --> 00:03:13,870
I've reported to the superiors
that I'm joining

49
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,150
the investigation of the Li Dewu case.

50
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,870
Have you found anything?

51
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,780
On the night in question,

52
00:03:20,810 --> 00:03:22,190
Li Dewu's parents never left home.

53
00:03:23,620 --> 00:03:24,660
They have alibis, so they

54
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:25,710
can be ruled out as suspects.

55
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:27,910
Ruling out his own parents

56
00:03:27,910 --> 00:03:29,300
as suspects—fairly reasonable.

57
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:30,910
What a brilliant judge you are.

58
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,210
After having dinner with them,

59
00:03:33,210 --> 00:03:34,900
Chen Hong and her child

60
00:03:34,900 --> 00:03:36,750
went back home at about 10:00.

61
00:03:36,750 --> 00:03:37,910
Then she tucked her kid in.

62
00:03:38,470 --> 00:03:40,310
Theoretically, she can also be ruled out
as a suspect.

63
00:03:43,530 --> 00:03:44,340
What about the driver?

64
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:48,280
He said he waited all night
for Li Dewu to page him.

65
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,240
Though it never happened,

66
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,300
he still chose to stay at home.

67
00:03:51,410 --> 00:03:52,079
Is it true?

68
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:53,930
About 80% true.

69
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,590
His neighbors can prove

70
00:03:57,860 --> 00:03:59,520
that the car was parked downstairs
the whole time.

71
00:04:00,020 --> 00:04:01,030
Around nine o'clock,

72
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,630
a kid even climbed onto the car.

73
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:04,480
So Wang Liye scolded him.

74
00:04:08,580 --> 00:04:09,460
I'll ask again in a few days.

75
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:12,060
This needs to be 100% confirmed.

76
00:04:14,650 --> 00:04:20,070
My son...

77
00:04:18,209 --> 00:04:25,060
[Anatomy Room 2]

78
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:21,510
I can't bear to hear this.

79
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:25,510
A three.

80
00:04:25,510 --> 00:04:26,060
A five!

81
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:26,690
A seven!

82
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:30,340
Pass. I'll pass.

83
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,270
Three of a kind plus one.

84
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,040
Three of a kind plus one.

85
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,510
Bomb!

86
00:04:32,510 --> 00:04:33,240
A pair of sevens.

87
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:33,870
A pair of eights.

88
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:34,930
A pair of jacks.

89
00:04:35,500 --> 00:04:36,570
A pair of kings!

90
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,659
Is it a good time to play poker?

91
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,330
Don't you have work to do?

92
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:41,420
Go!

93
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:42,300
Get back to your work!

94
00:04:42,570 --> 00:04:43,360
With the director gone,

95
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,430
who's going to pay us?

96
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,870
Yeah. Who's going to pay us?

97
00:04:45,870 --> 00:04:47,190
Right. Who's going to pay us?

98
00:04:48,890 --> 00:04:49,570
What to do with it?

99
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,130
Let me do it.

100
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,130
Let you do what?

101
00:04:55,370 --> 00:04:56,440
You're just a woman.

102
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:57,980
What are you capable of?

103
00:04:58,220 --> 00:04:59,300
Dad, have you forgotten?

104
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,620
I used to be an accountant in the factory.

105
00:05:01,950 --> 00:05:03,430
If I hadn't married Dewu...

106
00:05:04,370 --> 00:05:05,740
Just because you can keep the books,

107
00:05:05,740 --> 00:05:07,160
does that mean you can manage a company?

108
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:09,830
You haven't seen much of the world.

109
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,800
Women are only competent

110
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,740
in the kitchen.

111
00:05:13,570 --> 00:05:15,620
No, Dad. You have no idea.

112
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:16,860
Doing business nowadays

113
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,560
is different from before you retired.

114
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:21,560
These days, business is about going out,
begging for favors,

115
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:23,370
drinking heavily with others,
and networking.

116
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,450
You've gotten used to being a leader.

117
00:05:25,810 --> 00:05:26,830
Is it appropriate for you

118
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,770
to swallow your pride
and beg for favors?

119
00:05:29,130 --> 00:05:30,920
But I don't have a problem with it.
I'm up for this.

120
00:05:32,180 --> 00:05:33,920
I have to get the company into good shape

121
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:35,330
so I can hand it over whole and intact

122
00:05:35,330 --> 00:05:36,740
to your grandson in the future.

123
00:05:43,420 --> 00:05:44,890
After all, he's only heir

124
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:47,250
of the Li family now.

125
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:08,270
Ms. Chen,

126
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:09,990
a brief introduction to you.

127
00:06:10,130 --> 00:06:12,100
We're now in the warehouse.

128
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:14,240
-And this is...
-The shipping area.

129
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,010
Yes, exactly.

130
00:06:15,010 --> 00:06:16,300
The main function here is to

131
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,770
transport oil in from outside.

132
00:06:21,130 --> 00:06:23,040
Well, after Mr. Li's passing,

133
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,690
the workers have been
somewhat slacking off.

134
00:06:24,690 --> 00:06:25,670
I know. It's okay.

135
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,860
You two enjoy whistling, right?

136
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:30,070
Come on, let's hear who whistles louder.

137
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:31,330
The winner stays.

138
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:32,940
The loser gets fired.

139
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:34,770
R-Really?

140
00:06:38,890 --> 00:06:40,770
Alright. You whistle louder.
You get to stay.

141
00:06:40,770 --> 00:06:41,390
And you are fired.

142
00:06:41,950 --> 00:06:42,600
Thank you, Ms. Chen.

143
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:43,250
Off you go.

144
00:06:43,250 --> 00:06:43,750
I...

145
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:45,750
You're Zhang, an accountant, right?

146
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,190
There is

147
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:48,040
a payment of 324,150 yuan

148
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,920
overdue by six months.

149
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,200
How come we haven't received it yet?

150
00:06:50,659 --> 00:06:51,500
Whatever the reason,

151
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,330
I'll give you one more week.

152
00:06:52,330 --> 00:06:53,450
Collect it in time,

153
00:06:53,659 --> 00:06:54,510
or you'll be fired.

154
00:06:56,570 --> 00:06:58,070
Leave the room. Go.

155
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:00,480
Alright.

156
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,230
Take her to HR to process her dismissal.

157
00:07:03,010 --> 00:07:03,770
I...

158
00:07:04,570 --> 00:07:05,620
Well, just go.

159
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,240
No, please, Mr. Chen.

160
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,010
Call me again if there's a similar event.

161
00:07:13,010 --> 00:07:14,670
I have so much to learn from you.

162
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,920
Okay. Bye.

163
00:07:22,570 --> 00:07:23,370
Why stare at me?

164
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:25,070
I'm just wondering

165
00:07:25,070 --> 00:07:26,180
how you managed to become

166
00:07:26,570 --> 00:07:28,310
completely different in just a few days.

167
00:07:29,930 --> 00:07:30,750
Am I any different?

168
00:07:31,540 --> 00:07:32,290
How so?

169
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,659
You're prettier. That's how.

170
00:07:35,330 --> 00:07:36,180
So impressive.

171
00:07:36,180 --> 00:07:36,920
So full of swagger.

172
00:07:37,540 --> 00:07:38,420
Of course.

173
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:41,040
Drive.

174
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:08,630
Eyes on the road.

175
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:29,930
No, wait.

176
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,970
Dong, what is this about?

177
00:08:32,070 --> 00:08:32,650
Are you serious?

178
00:08:33,510 --> 00:08:34,000
Easy!

179
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:36,549
Let go of him.

180
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,250
What is this for?

181
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:48,860
"What is this for?"

182
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:52,910
When will you pay

183
00:08:52,910 --> 00:08:53,650
the remaining 50,000?

184
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,580
What 50,000?

185
00:08:55,820 --> 00:08:56,820
Don't play dumb with me.

186
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,860
I mean the 50,000 you owe me.

187
00:08:59,290 --> 00:09:00,480
W-What?

188
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:01,790
Still putting on an act, huh?

189
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:03,910
I did the work for you,

190
00:09:04,410 --> 00:09:05,630
yet you haven't paid in full.

191
00:09:07,820 --> 00:09:10,270
No, you didn't finish the work.

192
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:11,630
The police said

193
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,740
that Li Dewu slipped on soybeans,
fell, and died.

194
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,130
Logically speaking,

195
00:09:15,130 --> 00:09:16,410
you should refund me the previous 50,000.

196
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:17,580
That's crap.

197
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,010
Let me ask you.

198
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:20,650
Li Dewu died

199
00:09:20,650 --> 00:09:22,240
in Yuhong Stadium, didn't he?

200
00:09:22,740 --> 00:09:24,240
And I, Liang Zhendong,

201
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,750
rule Yuhong Stadium, don't I?

202
00:09:27,250 --> 00:09:27,790
Yes.

203
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:29,370
That's it then.

204
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:31,480
You bidding was done

205
00:09:31,890 --> 00:09:32,840
in my territory.

206
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,080
Shouldn't you pay up?

207
00:09:35,370 --> 00:09:35,820
But I...

208
00:09:35,820 --> 00:09:36,500
But what?

209
00:09:36,770 --> 00:09:37,600
What's there to say?

210
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,130
You came to the nightclub that day.

211
00:09:41,890 --> 00:09:43,370
My pals and the waiters here

212
00:09:43,370 --> 00:09:44,440
all saw you, didn't they?

213
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:48,310
If one of them goes to the police

214
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:49,840
and blabs...

215
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:50,820
No, no.

216
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:51,510
Don't.

217
00:09:51,510 --> 00:09:52,030
Dong, please.

218
00:09:53,130 --> 00:09:54,150
Don't tell the police about it.

219
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:55,530
Why make a fuss at all?

220
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:57,390
Don't you just want that 50,000 yuan?

221
00:09:57,390 --> 00:09:58,410
I'll definitely pay up.

222
00:09:58,750 --> 00:10:00,150
Just give me a few days, okay?

223
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:00,840
I'm begging you.

224
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:04,960
Fine. I won't tell the police.

225
00:10:07,620 --> 00:10:08,340
You get what I mean?

226
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:11,200
Okay, I'll pay you within three months.

227
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,150
Cut that crap!

228
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,860
I mean three days!

229
00:10:15,410 --> 00:10:16,460
Three months?

230
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:42,080
I had a dream about Wu.

231
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,200
What did he say in it?

232
00:10:52,410 --> 00:10:53,890
He asked what time it was.

233
00:10:56,580 --> 00:10:58,750
What do you think that means?

234
00:11:00,580 --> 00:11:01,600
Stop thinking about it.

235
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:04,130
Go to sleep.

236
00:11:27,860 --> 00:11:29,530
He forgot his watch.

237
00:11:31,630 --> 00:11:32,750
I need to burn it so it'll reach him.

238
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,390
That foolish broad.

239
00:12:22,980 --> 00:12:24,460
She's never home.

240
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:27,010
Where did she place my son's watch?

241
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,960
Please say something.

242
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,510
Say what?

243
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,150
Is there a topic?

244
00:13:20,290 --> 00:13:21,510
Didn't you suggest

245
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,770
that we leave Tiecheng together

246
00:13:22,770 --> 00:13:24,050
for somewhere far away?

247
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:25,530
When did I ever suggest that?

248
00:13:25,530 --> 00:13:27,240
Just two months ago. Don't you remember?

249
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:29,390
So you know it was two months ago.

250
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,010
Back then,

251
00:13:31,010 --> 00:13:31,790
I was abused every day.

252
00:13:31,790 --> 00:13:32,600
I asked you to take me away.

253
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,440
But what did you do?

254
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:34,840
You chickened out!

255
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,740
Now, Fatty Li is dead.

256
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,700
I'm in charge of the family's wealth

257
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,890
and the company.

258
00:13:40,890 --> 00:13:42,200
Someone else is taking care of my child.

259
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,410
It hasn't been long
since my good days started,

260
00:13:44,430 --> 00:13:45,910
and you're asking me to flee with you now?

261
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:47,200
You think I'm stupid or what?

262
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,720
Fine then.

263
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,580
We can stay here.

264
00:13:48,980 --> 00:13:50,100
But you need to give me another 50,000.

265
00:13:51,390 --> 00:13:53,220
You're literally asking me for money?

266
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:54,960
Calculate how many months
you have to work for 50,000!

267
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:56,840
The money is not for me.

268
00:13:57,700 --> 00:13:58,770
It's for Dong.

269
00:14:01,390 --> 00:14:02,220
Why him?

270
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,120
Previously, you had me ask him

271
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,460
to take Boss Wu out, didn't you?

272
00:14:05,460 --> 00:14:07,010
He said 50,000 wasn't enough,
and demanded 100,000.

273
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:08,660
You seemed pretty eager to me,

274
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:09,630
so I told him yes.

275
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,320
Did I allow you to agree with it
on my behalf?

276
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,490
Then what should I have done?

277
00:14:15,150 --> 00:14:15,530
Dad,

278
00:14:15,630 --> 00:14:16,840
w-w-we didn't kill Dewu!

279
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:17,720
Despicable adulterers.

280
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:18,750
Dad, we really didn't...

281
00:14:19,150 --> 00:14:20,240
You killed my son!

282
00:14:19,260 --> 00:14:21,040
♪ Two tigers ♪

283
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,320
Dad, Dad!

284
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,250
